 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "1 · En la oficina de alquiler",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Buenos días. ¿[[c1_tienes_una_reserva|Tienes una reserva]]?",
   "en": "Good morning. Do you have a booking?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_01_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, a nombre de Mateo. Un coche pequeño, por favor.",
   "en": "Yes, under the name Mateo. A small car, please.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Perfecto. ¿Me das tu [[c1_carne_de_conducir|carné de conducir]]?",
   "en": "Perfect. Can you give me your driving licence?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_03_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Aquí tienes. Es mi primera vez conduciendo en Madrid.",
   "en": "Here you are. It's my first time driving in Madrid.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡No pasa nada! Aquí tienes las [[c1_llaves|llaves]]. Es el coche blanco.",
   "en": "No problem! Here are the keys. It's the white car.",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_05_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. ¿Tengo que [[c1_devolver_el_coche|devolver el coche]] hoy?",
   "en": "Thanks. Do I have to return the car today?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, esta tarde, antes de las ocho.",
   "en": "Yes, this afternoon, before eight.",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_07_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale. ¿Algo más?",
   "en": "OK. Anything else?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Cuidado con la zona de bajas emisiones en el centro.",
   "en": "Be careful with the low-emission zone in the centre.",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_09_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Qué es eso?",
   "en": "What's that?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Una zona con normas especiales. El GPS te avisa.",
   "en": "An area with special rules. The GPS warns you.",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_11_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Perfecto, gracias. ¡Estoy un poco nervioso!",
   "en": "Perfect, thanks. I'm a bit nervous!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Tranquilo! Ponte el cinturón y ve despacio. ¡Buen viaje!",
   "en": "Relax! Put on your seatbelt and go slowly. Have a good trip!",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c1_13_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "2 · En la puerta de Carmen",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Mateo! ¡[[c2_lo_has_conseguido|Lo has conseguido]]!",
   "en": "Mateo! You did it!",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_01_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Hola, Carmen! Ha sido una aventura.",
   "en": "Hi, Carmen! It has been an adventure.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c2_que_tal_el_viaje|Qué tal el viaje]]?",
   "en": "How was the journey?",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_03_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Bien, pero en la glorieta me equivoqué de carril.",
   "en": "Fine, but at the roundabout I took the wrong lane.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Es normal! ¿Y [[c2_donde_has_aparcado|dónde has aparcado]]?",
   "en": "That's normal! And where have you parked?",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_05_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "En el parking de la esquina, como dijiste.",
   "en": "In the car park on the corner, as you said.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Muy bien! ¿Has aparcado recto?",
   "en": "Very good! Did you park straight?",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_07_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Bueno… un [[c2_poco_torcido|poco torcido]].",
   "en": "Well… a bit crooked.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ja, ja! No importa. ¿[[c2_tienes_hambre|Tienes hambre]]?",
   "en": "Ha ha! It doesn't matter. Are you hungry?",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_09_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, mucha. ¡Conducir da hambre!",
   "en": "Yes, very. Driving makes you hungry!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Pues sube. La comida está en la mesa.",
   "en": "Then come up. Lunch is on the table.",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_11_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Genial! ¿Qué has preparado?",
   "en": "Great! What have you made?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Tortilla de patatas y ensalada.",
   "en": "Spanish omelette and salad.",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c2_13_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "3 · Por la calle Serrano",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Mateo, ¿[[c3_estas_bien|estás bien]]? Estás muy serio.",
   "en": "Mateo, are you OK? You look very serious.",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_01_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Es que hay muchos coches y peatones.",
   "en": "It's just that there are lots of cars and pedestrians.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c3_tranqui|Tranqui]], Mateo, es solo Madrid.",
   "en": "Chill, Mateo, it's just Madrid.",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_03_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale… Voy despacio.",
   "en": "OK… I'm going slowly.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c3_ponemos_la_radio|Ponemos la radio]]?",
   "en": "Shall we put the radio on?",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_05_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, buena idea.",
   "en": "Yes, good idea.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Mira los escaparates. ¡Qué bonitos!",
   "en": "Look at the shop windows. How pretty!",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_07_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No puedo, ¡tengo que mirar el semáforo!",
   "en": "I can't, I have to watch the traffic light!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ja, ja! Tienes razón. Está en rojo, [[c3_frena|frena]].",
   "en": "Ha ha! You're right. It's red, brake.",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_09_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Ya freno. ¿Lo hago bien?",
   "en": "I'm braking. Am I doing it right?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c3_vaya_tela|Vaya tela]], qué bien conduces!",
   "en": "Wow, you drive so well!",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_11_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿De verdad? Gracias. [[c3_no_esta_chupado|No está chupado]].",
   "en": "Really? Thanks. It isn't easy.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Pero tú puedes. ¡Sigue así!",
   "en": "But you can do it. Keep it up!",
   "who": "Carmen",
   "audio": "audio/c3_13_Carmen.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "4 · Devolver el coche",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Buenas tardes. ¿Vienes a [[c4_devolver_el_coche|devolver el coche]]?",
   "en": "Good evening. Are you here to return the car?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_01_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, aquí tienes las llaves.",
   "en": "Yes, here are the keys.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. ¿[[c4_que_tal_todo|Qué tal todo]]?",
   "en": "Thanks. How was everything?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_03_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Bien, pero [[c4_ha_sido_dificil|ha sido difícil]].",
   "en": "Fine, but it was hard.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Primera vez conduciendo en Madrid?",
   "en": "First time driving in Madrid?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_05_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, es mi primera vez.",
   "en": "Yes, it's my first time.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Y el depósito? ¿Está lleno?",
   "en": "And the tank? Is it full?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_07_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, he echado gasolina antes de venir.",
   "en": "Yes, I put petrol in before coming.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Perfecto. ¿Algún problema con el coche?",
   "en": "Perfect. Any problem with the car?",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_09_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No, ninguno. Solo un taxi me pitó por la mañana.",
   "en": "No, none. Just a taxi honked at me this morning.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Eso es Madrid! Aquí tienes tu [[c4_factura|factura]].",
   "en": "That's Madrid! Here's your receipt.",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_11_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. ¡Qué bonito es el atardecer!",
   "en": "Thanks. What a beautiful sunset!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí. ¡Hasta la próxima aventura!",
   "en": "Yes. Until the next adventure!",
   "who": "Empleado",
   "audio": "audio/c4_13_Empleado.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "v",
   "es": "Frases clave de la semana"
  }
